Short:    Restores userdir comments for TechnoBBS
Type:     comm/bbs
Uploader: lauri.aalto@fipnet.fi
Author:   lauri.aalto@fipnet.fi

Have you ever been fucked up because you've lost all your file comments
when you backed up and then restored your user directories? Well, I have,
and didn't want to restore more than a hundred directory comments manually
to get that userlist feature working again, so I wrote this little script
to help all of you who have lost filenotes from your user directories. 

To use it you'll only have to run it, eg. type 'rx userdir.rexx' from your
shell prompt. It'll read the directory for a while and then start banging
those filenotes back and also write some stats to standard output.

The script is public domain, do whatever you want with it.

